---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Beach Lifestyle Market Trends | Premium Domain for Sale | Desert Rich"
  description="Beach tourism, coastal real estate, and Spanish-language lifestyle demand — why buy .com domains tied to coastal brands like LaPlayaEsVida.com."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main" class="pt-28 pb-20">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="section-kicker mb-3">Market trends</p>
      <h1 class="heading-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-[var(--text)] mb-4">Why beach lifestyle domains keep compounding</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[var(--text-muted)] mb-8">
        Coastal living sits at the intersection of tourism, real estate, wellness, and fashion. Brands that own the emotional language of “la playa” capture search demand and cultural affinity at once.
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-base text-[var(--text-muted)] mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">Spanish-speaking demand</h2>
        <p>
          With 636M+ Spanish speakers and 20+ countries where Spanish is official, a culturally native phrase domain is not a niche play — it is a cross-border brand asset.
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">Category economics</h2>
        <p>
          Beach tourism alone is projected above $180B with mid-single-digit annual growth. Adjacent spend in property, apparel, and experiential travel multiplies brand opportunities for one memorable .com.
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">SEO angle</h2>
        <p>
          Buyers searching “buy .com domains”, “domain marketplace”, and “[domain].com for sale” still convert on emotion. Exact lifestyle phrases outperform generic marketplace inventory when the story is clear.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="surface-card rounded-3xl p-6 mb-8">
        <p class="text-[var(--text)] font-semibold mb-2">Next step</p>
        <p class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">Acquire LaPlayaEsVida.com before a category competitor does.</p>
        <a href="/#investment" class="inline-flex mt-4 text-[var(--accent)] underline underline-offset-4">See pricing & CTAs</a>
      </aside>
      <nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)]">
        <a href="/guides/" class="underline underline-offset-4">All guides</a>
        <a href="/guides/domain-valuation/" class="underline underline-offset-4">Valuation guide</a>
        <a href="/guides/success-stories/" class="underline underline-offset-4">Success stories</a>
      </nav>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
